---
description: Automated tests, correctness evidence, test fixtures, fuzzing, exhaustive enumeration, differential testing, or automata equivalence
globs:
  - "project/tests/**"
  - "project/src/**"
  - "project/src/**/verification/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

Read and follow:

@agent/rules/testing-and-correctness.md

Important principles:

- tests must provide independent correctness evidence;
- do not derive implementation, oracle, and expected output from the same logic;
- preserve generated failures as deterministic regression cases;
- do not weaken tests merely to obtain a passing suite;
- report bounds, seeds, timeouts, and limitations honestly.
